  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "One way to support VRChat moderation is by enlisting volunteer moderators. This approach allows users to assist with moderation tasks and grants them limited privileges within VRChat worlds. Given VRChat's large community, implementing this may pose challenges, but monitoring these volunteer moderators can be a solution. Starting with volunteers in the Discord community can be a good initial step towards enhancing the platform. While VRChat may have concerns about user moderation, other platforms like RecRoom, Chillout VR, Resonite, and Meta Horizon have successfully utilized volunteer moderators in the past. This strategy could help enhance user safety by providing temporary timeouts instead of immediate banning, allowing team members to review reports effectively.",
